#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkArrow
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkArrow"
msgid "Lane Arrow"
msgstr "车道箭头"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkArrow.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkArrow.Desc"
msgid "Paints an arrow on a lane of a road. Aim at a road: the ghost shows it in the middle of the lane you aim at, pointing the way you look along the road. The mouse wheel picks the arrow, the click paints it. It takes the colour of the road's lane lines (the cyberpunk road's glow too); repaint it with a colour, or change its look in the Material tab. Dismantle it like any building."
msgstr "在道路的车道上绘制箭头。对准一条道路：预览会显示在你正对的车道中央，指向你沿道路的视线方向。滚轮可选择箭头，点击即可绘制。颜色取自道路的车道标线（赛博朋克道路的发光效果同样适用）；可用颜色重新涂装，或在材质标签页中更换外观。可像普通建筑一样拆除。"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkNumber
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkNumber"
msgid "Lane Number"
msgstr "车道编号"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkNumber.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkNumber.Desc"
msgid "Paints a single digit (0 to 9) on a lane of a road. Aim at a road: the ghost shows it in the middle of the lane you aim at, pointing the way you look along the road. The mouse wheel picks the digit, the click paints it. It takes the colour of the road's lane lines (the cyberpunk road's glow too); repaint it with a colour, or change its look in the Material tab. Dismantle it like any building."
msgstr "在道路的车道上绘制单个数字（0 至 9）。对准一条道路：预览会显示在你正对的车道中央，指向你沿道路的视线方向。滚轮可选择数字，点击即可绘制。颜色取自道路的车道标线（赛博朋克道路的发光效果同样适用）；可用颜色重新涂装，或在材质标签页中更换外观。可像普通建筑一样拆除。"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkVehicle
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkVehicle"
msgid "Lane Vehicle"
msgstr "车道车辆"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkVehicle.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkVehicle.Desc"
msgid "Paints a vehicle's map icon (Tractor, Truck, Explorer, Factory Cart or Cyberwagon) on a lane of a road. Aim at a road: the ghost shows it in the middle of the lane you aim at, pointing the way you look along the road. The mouse wheel picks the vehicle, the click paints it. It takes the colour of the road's lane lines (the cyberpunk road's glow too); repaint it with a colour, or change its look in the Material tab. Dismantle it like any building."
msgstr "在道路的车道上绘制车辆地图图标（拖拉机、卡车、探险者、工厂推车或赛博马车）。对准一条道路：预览会显示在你正对的车道中央，指向你沿道路的视线方向。滚轮可选择车辆，点击即可绘制。颜色取自道路的车道标线（赛博朋克道路的发光效果同样适用）；可用颜色重新涂装，或在材质标签页中更换外观。可像普通建筑一样拆除。"

