#. Key:	RoadMaterial.Concrete
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadMaterial.Concrete"
msgid "Concrete Blocks"
msgstr "混凝土块"

#. Key:	RoadMaterial.Concrete.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadMaterial.Concrete.Desc"
msgid "Light concrete blocks. Lane markings stay in the road's line colours."
msgstr "浅色混凝土块。车道标线保持道路标线的颜色。"

#. Key:	RoadMaterial.Cyber
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadMaterial.Cyber"
msgid "Cyberpunk"
msgstr "赛博朋克"

#. Key:	RoadMaterial.Cyber.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadMaterial.Cyber.Desc"
msgid "Matte plastic with circuit-board grooves in the primary colour. The lane lines glow in the secondary colour."
msgstr "哑光塑料，带主色调的电路板凹槽。车道标线以副色调发光。"

#. Key:	FenceWall_ConcreteLow.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_ConcreteLow.Name"
msgid "Concrete Fence Wall 1 m"
msgstr "混凝土围栏墙 1 米"

#. Key:	FenceWall_ConcreteLow.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_ConcreteLow.Desc"
msgid "1 m concrete wall, 0.5 m thick, plain concrete without the panel grooves: kerbs, parking edges, planters. Aim at a road to follow its edge (centred on the edge), or at an intersection to follow its curb; aim at the upper or lower half of a fence wall to stack another above or below it (1 m and 4 m walls stack together). Can be painted; the customizer's Material tab switches between concrete, FICSIT and steel. Costs what the 4 m wall does. Cost is per 4 m."
msgstr "1 米混凝土墙，厚 0.5 米，无板缝的素混凝土：适用于路缘、停车边缘、花坛。对准一条道路即可沿其边缘铺设（以边缘为中心），或对准路口沿其路缘铺设；对准围栏墙的上半或下半可向上或向下叠放（1 米与 4 米墙可互相叠放）。可涂装；定制器的材质标签页可在混凝土、FICSIT 和钢制之间切换。造价与 4 米墙相同。造价按每 4 米计算。"

#. Key:	FenceWall_FicsitLow.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_FicsitLow.Name"
msgid "FICSIT Fence Wall 1 m"
msgstr "FICSIT 围栏墙 1 米"

#. Key:	FenceWall_FicsitLow.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_FicsitLow.Desc"
msgid "1 m FICSIT wall, 0.5 m thick, like the game's 1 m FICSIT wall. Aim at a road to follow its edge (centred on the edge), or at an intersection to follow its curb; aim at the upper or lower half of a fence wall to stack another above or below it (1 m and 4 m walls stack together). Can be painted; the customizer's Material tab switches between concrete, FICSIT and steel. Costs what the 4 m wall does. Cost is per 4 m."
msgstr "1 米 FICSIT 墙，厚 0.5 米，与游戏内的 1 米 FICSIT 墙一致。对准一条道路即可沿其边缘铺设（以边缘为中心），或对准路口沿其路缘铺设；对准围栏墙的上半或下半可向上或向下叠放（1 米与 4 米墙可互相叠放）。可涂装；定制器的材质标签页可在混凝土、FICSIT 和钢制之间切换。造价与 4 米墙相同。造价按每 4 米计算。"

#. Key:	FenceWall_SteelLow.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_SteelLow.Name"
msgid "Steel Fence Wall 1 m"
msgstr "钢制围栏墙 1 米"

#. Key:	FenceWall_SteelLow.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_SteelLow.Desc"
msgid "1 m steel wall, 0.5 m thick, a solid wall with the look of the game's 1 m steel wall. Aim at a road to follow its edge (centred on the edge), or at an intersection to follow its curb; aim at the upper or lower half of a fence wall to stack another above or below it (1 m and 4 m walls stack together). Can be painted; the customizer's Material tab switches between concrete, FICSIT and steel. Costs what the 4 m wall does. Cost is per 4 m."
msgstr "1 米钢制墙，厚 0.5 米，实心墙体，外观与游戏内的 1 米钢墙一致。对准一条道路即可沿其边缘铺设（以边缘为中心），或对准路口沿其路缘铺设；对准围栏墙的上半或下半可向上或向下叠放（1 米与 4 米墙可互相叠放）。可涂装；定制器的材质标签页可在混凝土、FICSIT 和钢制之间切换。造价与 4 米墙相同。造价按每 4 米计算。"

#. Key:	FenceWall_SignLow.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_SignLow.Name"
msgid "Sign Wall 1 m"
msgstr "标牌墙 1 米"

#. Key:	FenceWall_SignLow.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,FenceWall_SignLow.Desc"
msgid "1 m wall, 0.5 m thick, that shows a sign design along its whole road side, repeated every 8 m (the design of a 4 m Label Sign, scaled up to 8 x 1 m). Press E on it to edit the design with the game's sign editor. Aim at a road to follow its edge, or at an intersection to follow its curb; scroll with the snap key held to turn it round; aim at the upper or lower half of a fence wall to stack another above or below it (1 m and 4 m walls stack together). Ends and top in matte metal, circuit grooves on the back. Costs what the 4 m sign wall does. Cost is per 8 m."
msgstr "1 米墙，厚 0.5 米，沿其整段朝路一侧展示标牌图案，每 8 米重复一次（即 4 米标签牌的图案，放大至 8 x 1 米）。对它按 E 可用游戏的标牌编辑器编辑图案。对准一条道路即可沿其边缘铺设，或对准路口沿其路缘铺设；按住吸附键滚动可翻转朝向；对准围栏墙的上半或下半可向上或向下叠放（1 米与 4 米墙可互相叠放）。两端和顶部为哑光金属，背面有电路凹槽。造价与 4 米标牌墙相同。造价按每 8 米计算。"

