#. Key:	LaneText.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,LaneText.Name"
msgid "Lane Text"
msgstr "车道文字"

#. Key:	LaneText.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,LaneText.Desc"
msgid "Text painted down a lane of a road, one upright character after another, read from top to bottom looking down the lane (the first character is the farthest). Any language. Chosen in the customizer (Road Lines > Markings): write the text in its box (R opens it again), aim at a lane and click. It takes the colour of the road's lane lines (the cyberpunk road's glow too). A paint job: to change it, dismantle it and paint it again; middle click copies its text. Free to build."
msgstr "沿道路车道纵向绘制的文字，字符依次正立，沿车道向下看时自上而下阅读（第一个字符在最远处）。支持任意语言。在定制器中设置（道路标线 > 标线）：在文本框中输入文字（按 R 可再次打开），对准车道点击即可绘制。颜色取自道路的车道标线（赛博朋克道路的发光效果同样适用）。它属于涂装：要修改需先拆除再重新绘制；中键点击可复制其文字。建造免费。"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkText
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkText"
msgid "Lane Text"
msgstr "车道文字"

#. Key:	RoadLines.MarkText.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadLines.MarkText.Desc"
msgid "Paints text down a lane of a road, one upright character after another, read from top to bottom looking down the lane (the first character is the farthest); any language. Picking it opens a box to write the text (R opens it again). Aim at a road: the ghost shows the text in the middle of the lane you aim at; the click paints it. It takes the colour of the road's lane lines (the cyberpunk road's glow too). A paint job: to change it, dismantle it and paint it again; middle click on painted text copies it."
msgstr "沿道路车道纵向绘制文字，字符依次正立，沿车道向下看时自上而下阅读（第一个字符在最远处）；支持任意语言。选中该项会打开文本框输入文字（按 R 可再次打开）。对准一条道路：预览会显示在你正对的车道中央；点击即可绘制。颜色取自道路的车道标线（赛博朋克道路的发光效果同样适用）。它属于涂装：要修改需先拆除再重新绘制；中键点击已绘制的文字可复制其内容。"

