#. Key:	Tunnel.Name
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,Tunnel.Name"
msgid "Tunnel Arch"
msgstr "隧道拱"

#. Key:	Tunnel.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,Tunnel.Desc"
msgid "A rounded concrete arch over roads, a tunnel shell following their curve. Click the first side: a road or walking path edge, or a fence wall (the arch then rises from its top). Click the other side: the same road's other edge, the far edge of a road beside it, or another fence wall; the arch spans everything between and runs along the whole stretch where the two sides run side by side (cut the road or fence for a shorter tunnel). Then aim up or down to set the arc, up to a semicircle (the angle is shown on screen), and click to build. Ceiling lights hang inside it; wall attachments snap to nine points around the arch, inside and outside. Paintable. Cost is per 16 m2 of shell."
msgstr "横跨道路的圆拱混凝土结构，隧道外壳贴合道路曲线。点击第一侧：道路或步行道边缘，或围栏墙（此时拱将从墙顶起拱）。点击另一侧：同一条道路的另一侧边缘、旁边道路的远端边缘，或另一道围栏墙；拱将横跨其间，并沿两侧并行的整段延伸（切割道路或护栏可获得更短的隧道）。随后上下瞄准设定弧度，最大半圆（角度会显示在屏幕上），点击即建造。内部顶部悬挂照明灯；墙体附件可吸附到拱周九个点位，内侧外侧均可。可涂装。造价按每 16 平方米壳体计算。"

