#. Key:	RoadSlopes.Desc
#: Content/Text/ST_RoadMaker.uasset
msgctxt "RoadMakerAssets,RoadSlopes.Desc"
msgid "Banks a raised road, walking path or intersection down to the terrain (cement blocks, solid to walk and drive on; 1 : 1.5). Roads: aim at the side you want, the cyan cage shows its bank; click to add it (each side on its own, other roads are ignored). Intersections: curb by curb. Hold the snap key for both sides / all curbs. None where the ground is level with the edge; not possible where the ground is more than 8 m below (red lines). Aim at a bank (red cage) and click to remove it. Off on new pieces; cut, adjusted and copied roads keep them and are measured again. Free."
msgstr ""

